  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Atlas Solar PV Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The transaction involves financing the construction, operation, and maintenance of the Atlas Solar Project, which comprises a photovoltaic park with an installed capacity of 201 MWp / 160 MWac, its transmission line, and associated civil works such as roads, substations, and other necessary infrastructure for energy supply. The project is located in the municipalities of Ibagu&#xe9; and Piedras (Tolima), approximately 200 km from Bogot&#xe1; D.C. The IDB Invest loan will cover approximately US$55 million of the total estimated project costs of US$160 million.</narrative>
  </description>
